lic","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/json","state":"uploaded","size":652,"digest":"sha256:6fd791f78f7e70ebca2174dd184812a9d9a736cc2214d7475a87796d7ccd9f3d","download_count":0,"created_at":"2026-11-16T15:10:29Z","updated_at":"2026-11-16T15:10:29Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/enginsoysal/engacer-os/releases/download/m121-v0.12.1/m12stage1-starter-manifest.json"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/enginsoysal/engacer-os/tarball/m121-v0.12.1","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/enginsoysal/engacer-os/zipball/m121-v0.12.1","body":"# Engacer OS M12.1 / 0.12.1 â€” shared native controls\r\n\r\nNative qualification passed on 16 November 2026 within **M12-STAGE1-VM-v1**.\r\n[Exact-source acceptance](https://github.com/enginsoysal/engacer-os/blob/98862e51abecfe3049a0c7fe4f5e683cdc11f2c2/evidence/M12/1/acceptance-results.json) verifies\r\n568 compiled inputs, fourteen build/ZIP digests, fourteen native checks,\r\nthree BIOS and three exact-starter VMware checks, twelve cached/full comparisons,\r\nand measured [resources](https://github.com/enginsoysal/engacer-os/blob/98862e51abecfe3049a0c7fe4f5e683cdc11f2c2/evidence/M12/1/resources.json).\r\nGitHub assets and fresh website readback are separate required publication gates.\r\n\r\nBuild: `981a97dc89216bba34db0b02c25adab2`.\r\nISO SHA256: `18545414d308da95b04bc5b849d871971ec396d7e5eb58740ec24945cf63a113`.\r\nVMware ZIP SHA256: `5104ea1aa519a907f7180682a2d25e91fb9b7261ca196171166f0c4ab970bf67`.\r\n\r\n[Official M12.1 release](https://github.com/enginsoysal/engacer-os/releases/tag/m121-v0.12.1).\r\n\r\n## Changes\r\n\r\nDesktop buttons and text fields share readable light/dark states, hover, press,\r\ndisabled presentation and visible keyboard focus. Activation remains on release\r\ninside the target. The Files scrollbar uses actual row counts, thumb dragging,\r\ntrack paging, Home/End and cancellation; its keyboard ownership cannot leak into\r\nthe USB view or address field. Start letters, selected text and desktop feedback\r\nuse the same accent contrast decision.\r\n\r\nInter body, secondary, section and heading masks use actual physical sizes at\r\n100/150/200%. Shared masks reduce coverage by 19,662 bytes compared with M11.6.\r\nThere is no new continuous animation or per-window framebuffer. App icons and\r\nunified USB navigation are later ordered stages, not features claimed here.\r\n\r\n## Install and use\r\n\r\n[Follow the eight-step VMware guide](https://github.com/enginsoysal/engacer-os/blob/98862e51abecfe3049a0c7fe4f5e683cdc11f2c2/docs/handbook/install-m121.md) and\r\n[try the shared controls](https://github.com/enginsoysal/engacer-os/blob/98862e51abecfe3049a0c7fe4f5e683cdc11f2c2/docs/handbook/components-m121.md).\r\nUse the complete matching `EngacerOS-M12STAGE1-VMware.zip`, or its matching\r\n`EngacerOS-M12STAGE1.iso`. The starter contains a new blank growable 20-GiB SATA\r\ndisk, 128 MiB configured RAM, two CPUs and UEFI with Secure Boot off. Installation\r\nis real; no installed user disk is included. The matching ISO may remain attached.\r\n\r\nThe release asset set includes the ISO, VMware ZIP, build/starter manifests,\r\nnative images/maps, third-party notices, corresponding 7-Zip source and license\r\nmaterials. `M12STAGE1-SHA256SUMS.txt` covers the other 19 assets.\r\n\r\n## Qualification boundaries\r\n\r\nM12-STAGE1-VM-v1 is stage-specific: native QEMU SATA/UEFI and BIOS installation,\r\nretained-ISO restart, two ordinary disk boots, the exact enabled-device VMware\r\nstarter, component/focus/scroll input, real 150% and 3840Ã—2160 rendering, bounded\r\nresources and cached/full movement comparison. The complete controller/device\r\nand original-application regression remains M12.18. M11.6's broader matrix is\r\nhistorical proof for its own immutable bytes, not inherited proof for M12.1.\r\n\r\nPhysical hardware, ARM, vendor GPU 3D, general DOS/Windows compatibility and a\r\nhuman usability study are not qualified by this stage. Agent scenario and visual\r\nreview are explicitly separate. [Implementation decisions](https://github.com/enginsoysal/engacer-os/blob/98862e51abecfe3049a0c7fe4f5e683cdc11f2c2/docs/architecture/components-m121.md)\r\nrecord fixes and limitations; [current status](https://github.com/enginsoysal/engacer-os/blob/98862e51abecfe3049a0c7fe4f5e683cdc11f2c2/docs/roadmap/status.md) tracks the\r\nordered remaining stages. GitHub assets and the native BrixCanvas homepage must\r\npass fresh readback independently of native runtime acceptance.\r\n"}